Eleven's mother, secrets about Hopper's old&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:08.560 --> 00:05:12.720
life in New York City, Robin's sophomore year&nbsp;
of high school and Max's life in California.

00:05:12.720 --> 00:05:16.640
As I've discussed many times on this channel,&nbsp;
Stranger Things, with it's psychokinetic heroes&nbsp;&nbsp;

